1
00:00:03,286 --> 00:00:06,226
Open Commerce, Point of sale, Shifts.

2
00:00:06,226 --> 00:00:11,354
It lists every shift, newest first, each Open or Closed, with when it

3
00:00:11,354 --> 00:00:13,474
opened and who opened it.

4
00:00:13,474 --> 00:00:16,346
A closed shift shows its difference.

5
00:00:16,921 --> 00:00:20,116
The list in the header filters by register.

6
00:00:20,116 --> 00:00:25,921
Shifts, on a register in the registers list, opens the same list for that register.

7
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:28,314
Click View to open a shift.

8
00:00:28,314 --> 00:00:32,475
It shows how many Sales it took, their Total, the Cash kept, what

9
00:00:32,475 --> 00:00:36,870
cards paid in Card, what gift cards paid, and what has been Refunded.

10
00:00:37,329 --> 00:00:42,180
Under Cash drawer, the Opening float, plus the cash put in, less the

11
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:45,195
cash taken out, gives the Expected cash.

12
00:00:45,195 --> 00:00:49,259
Each movement is listed with its reason and who made it.

13
00:00:49,754 --> 00:00:54,277
For a closed shift, Counted is the cash staff counted, and Difference is

14
00:00:54,277 --> 00:00:55,727
how far off it was.

15
00:00:55,727 --> 00:00:58,916
A negative difference means the drawer was short.

16
00:00:58,916 --> 00:01:01,874
The note given at the close is shown with it.

